33682.description:
Kosumo has a serious medical condition that has kept her in the hospital ever since she was a child. Since Kosumo's blood type is rare, it impossible to find a donor.<br><br>
While Kosumo is on the verge of death, out in the city, the 99th Generation Miko, Himiko-sama, gets into a terrible accident while trying to save a child. She is rushed to the hospital, and there her fate crosses with Kosumo's.<br><br>
When the hospital discovers that Himiko has the same rare blood type as Kosumo, they decide to make her a donor, since Himiko is sure to die as a result of the accident. Kosumo recovers and moves back to Tokyo, but later finds out that Himiko's blood isn't the only thing flowing inside her&hellip;

33961.description:
The man whose eyes are re-awakening, Yoshiyuki. At the age of 18 years old he lives a life of hopelessness, and thus visits the host club &ldquo;Platinum&rdquo; in Shibuya. They all thought it. &ldquo;Yoshiyuki wouldn&rsquo;t be suited to a become a host.&rdquo; At that time, only the number one host Taku looked into his eyes and saw that they were different from those of ordinary men&hellip;
